##! Please refer to the documentation at
##! https://coreruleset.org/docs/development/regex_assembly/.

##!+ i

##!^ \b
##! Between the function name and the opening parenthesis, allow non-word
##! characters and block comments with a body (MySQL treats `/*x*/` as a
##! token separator). The branches cannot match the same character, which
##! avoids exponential backtracking: a `/` is only consumed by the comment
##! branch, written with the unrolling-the-loop technique.
##!$ (?:[^\w/]|/\*[^*]*\*+(?:[^/*][^*]*\*+)*/)*\(

##!> include-except sql-injection-function-names sql-injection-function-names-fps-pl1
